window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I thought I knew suffering. I was wrong.</p> <p>I thought I knew what it meant to be in pain. I was wrong.</p> <p>I thought I knew what it meant to lose everything. I was wrong.</p> <p>I thought . . . I thought . . . I thought life got better after I finally got everything I dreamed of, yet here I am a broken man. With nothing to live for but revenge.</p> <p>He took everything from me. My friends, my wife, my child.</p> <p>Now, I shall show him what it means to go to war against a man who has lost everything and will die a thousand deaths to get it back.</p>"; 
